        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an invoice data extraction assistant.\n\nFirst determine whether the email contains a genuine invoice, receipt, bill, or payment confirmation.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nA promotional email, advertisement, product offer, upgrade offer, newsletter, discount, or marketing email is NOT an invoice.\n\nFor example, an email saying:\n\"Get a year of Plus for ₹4,700\"\nis a promotional offer and must NOT be treated as an invoice.\n\nA price, currency, product name, or \"billed annually\" statement alone is NOT enough to classify an email as an invoice.\n\nA genuine invoice should contain transaction/invoice evidence such as an invoice number, receipt number, billing details, invoice date, purchase/payment information, tax information, or a clear confirmation that a transaction has occurred.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"is_invoice\": false,\n  \"vendor_name\": null,\n  \"vendor_gstin\": null,\n  \"invoice_number\": null,\n  \"invoice_date\": null,\n  \"due_date\": null,\n  \"currency\": null,\n  \"subtotal\": null,\n  \"cgst\": null,\n  \"sgst\": null,\n  \"total_amount\": null,\n  \"payment_status\": null,\n  \"items\": []\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- Set \"is_invoice\" to true only when the email contains evidence of a genuine invoice, receipt, bill, or completed payment transaction.\n- Set \"is_invoice\" to false for promotional, advertising, marketing, newsletter, discount, trial, upgrade, or product-offer emails.\n- If \"is_invoice\" is false, all invoice fields must be null and \"items\" must be an empty array.\n- Do not treat an advertised price as a paid amount.\n- Do not guess missing values.\n- Extract only information actually present in the email.\n- Use numbers for monetary amounts.\n- Remove currency symbols and commas from numeric amounts.\n- Preserve invoice dates as written.\n- Include every invoice item when the email is a genuine invoice.\n- Return only JSON.\n\nINVOICE EMAIL TEXT:\n\n{{ $('Get a message').item.json.text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1296,
        160
      ],
